    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "And so the wedding was held. Himavan gave his daughter away, and Brahma himself was the priest.",
     "text_hi": "और फिर विवाह हुआ। हिमवान ने कन्यादान किया, और स्वयं ब्रह्मा पुरोहित बने।",
     "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Parvati placed the garland around Shiva's neck, and they walked around the sacred fire together.",
     "text_hi": "पार्वती ने शिव के गले में वरमाला डाली, और दोनों ने साथ मिलकर पवित्र अग्नि के फेरे लिए।",
     "cam": "two:parvati,shiva",
     "sfx": "sparkle"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "The gods sang, the apsaras danced, and the ganas danced worst of all, and loudest.",
     "text_hi": "देवता गाए, अप्सराएँ नाचीं, और गण सबसे बेढंगे, सबसे ज़ोर से नाचे।",
     "camMove": true,
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
