    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Then Shiva and Parvati returned to Kailasa, with Nandi and all the ganas. The goddess who had been Sati was by Shiva's side once more.",
     "text_hi": "फिर शिव और पार्वती नंदी और सभी गणों के साथ कैलास लौट आए। जो देवी कभी सती थीं, वे फिर से शिव के साथ थीं।",
     "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "In time, their son Kartikeya would be born, and he would destroy the asura Taraka. But that is a story for another day.",
     "text_hi": "समय आने पर उनके पुत्र कार्तिकेय जन्म लेंगे, और वे तारकासुर का वध करेंगे। पर वह कथा फिर कभी।",
     "cam": "two:shiva,parvati",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
   ],
